  - key: 
    value: 
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: '- Appears on all reels and substitutes for all symbols except'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: '- 3 or more Scatters anywhere on reels triggers 3 <color=#ffea00>Magic
      Ball Free Games</color>.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "- Each reel has a Star Panel with random number of Star Sockets from 1
      to 3.\n- Whenever              appears on a reel, player fills one empty Star
      Socket on Star Panel of the same reel.\n- Once all Star Sockets are filled on
      a reel, Lucky Star Feature is triggered on that reel.\n      - Lucky Star Feature
      awards Wild Reel for the same number of spins as the number of Sockets filled.\n-
      Once Lucky Star Feature ends, the number of Star Sockets on that Star Panel
      gets reset."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "- 3 or more Scatters anywhere on reels triggers 3 Magic Ball Free Games.\n-
      At the beginning of each Free Game, Re-spin Feature is triggered.\n      - 3
      \             symbols are randomly placed on reels and get locked until the
      end of the current Re-spin Feature.\n      - After reels stop, all              symbols
      turn to the same random symbol except              and itself.\n      - If there
      is the same matching symbol from reel spin, then both symbols revealed from
      \             and matching symbol from reel spin, all turn to              ,
      getting locked and current Re-spin Feature continues.\n      - If              appears
      anywhere on reels during Re-spin Feature, it becomes locked until the end of
      current Re-spin Feature.\n      - During Re-spin Feature, free spin counts are
      not deducted.\n      - Re-spin Feature continues until there is no matching
      symbol from reel spin.\n- No re-trigger is allowed.\n- No Lucky Star Feature
      is triggered during Magic Ball Free Games."
